# PII denylist (generated from private data; never commit)
tools/.pii-denylist.txt
# Ambiguous tier: single-word company names that are also ordinary words (WARN-only)
tools/.pii-denylist-ambiguous.txt
# Every token the generator has ever emitted, so a company that leaves data/ keeps
# its coverage. Holds real names by construction - must never be tracked.
tools/.pii-denylist-retired.txt
# Hand-maintained PII additions: real people/companies that exist only in
# data/projects/, data/source-articles/ or the personal vault, so the generator's
# automatic sources cannot see them. Holds real names -- never commit.
tools/.pii-manual-additions.txt

